WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.000 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 17=

01:41.600 --> 01:42.955
I will be home in half an hour.

01:51.240 --> 01:52.040
You are still here?

01:54.555 --> 01:56.040
Gu Yan has not submitted his draft.

01:56.040 --> 01:57.240
I want to wait a bit longer.

01:57.440 --> 02:00.040
If he still has not replied at 9 PM

02:00.040 --> 02:01.120
or submitted the draft,

02:01.120 --> 02:02.220
I will have to go find him.

02:02.360 --> 02:02.980
I will call him.

02:03.520 --> 02:04.530
No need. His phone is off.

02:04.666 --> 02:05.850
I have been calling all night.

02:08.040 --> 02:08.840
I will go find him.

02:08.880 --> 02:09.990
You go back and rest first.

02:10.040 --> 02:11.990
Once he submits it,
you still need to typeset it.

02:12.480 --> 02:13.560
He is not at his place.

02:13.560 --> 02:14.470
I checked this afternoon.

02:14.480 --> 02:15.000
I see.

02:15.000 --> 02:16.240
After you get home, tell Zhou Mei

02:16.240 --> 02:18.177
I will be back later
and ask her to wait for me.

02:26.500 --> 02:29.420
(Keeping stories alive together.)

03:07.600 --> 03:08.680
Is Gu Yan here, San Mei?

03:08.840 --> 03:09.240
No.

03:10.044 --> 03:11.120
Do you know where he went?

03:11.480 --> 03:12.520
I cannot reach him.

03:12.760 --> 03:14.488
His phone is off, and he is not at home.

03:15.480 --> 03:16.760
Other than your company,

03:17.080 --> 03:20.240
his place, and here, I don't know
where else he would go.

03:20.577 --> 03:21.880
He does not have other friends.

03:22.360 --> 03:23.720
If he contacts you,

03:24.240 --> 03:25.640
please tell him to call me back.

03:25.650 --> 03:27.680
Also, ask him to send
the draft as soon as possible.

03:27.680 --> 03:28.080
Thank you.

03:28.680 --> 03:30.600
So what you are worried
about is where he is,

03:30.680 --> 03:31.990
or whether he can submit the draft?

03:32.160 --> 03:32.800
To me,

03:32.800 --> 03:34.000
both matter.

03:34.200 --> 03:35.240
It is the same issue.

03:35.720 --> 03:36.840
He treats you like family.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.600
You treat him as a tool to make money.

03:43.760 --> 03:45.560
You should understand that relationships

03:46.400 --> 03:47.440
are not either-or.

04:24.220 --> 04:25.210
You didn't find Gu Yan?

04:26.520 --> 04:27.420
No draft either?

04:28.160 --> 04:28.560
No.

04:31.320 --> 04:32.960
Looks like today is not a good day.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.620
Tell me about you first.

04:38.200 --> 04:39.030
Three against one.

04:39.120 --> 04:39.880
What happened?

04:43.977 --> 04:45.400
I think Zhang Yousen already knows

04:45.400 --> 04:46.520
about Lawyer Bei and me.

04:47.311 --> 04:48.160
So he deliberately

04:48.160 --> 04:49.720
brought Lawyer Bei and his wife.

04:50.288 --> 04:51.533
He was the one against three.

04:52.520 --> 04:54.280
What do you mean by you and Lawyer Bei?

04:55.088 --> 04:56.622
What is going on between you two?

04:58.577 --> 04:59.533
She does not know?

05:04.180 --> 05:04.740
That is right.

05:05.555 --> 05:06.840
Exactly what you are thinking.

05:09.320 --> 05:10.840
Welcome to the adult world.

05:11.720 --> 05:12.200
Then, you...

05:12.200 --> 05:13.760
What about you and Zhang Yousen?

05:14.520 --> 05:16.120
They are boss and employee.

05:16.240 --> 05:17.240
Just listen.

05:17.760 --> 05:18.640
Do not ask so much.

05:20.880 --> 05:22.760
So, how did Lawyer Bei perform today?

05:25.320 --> 05:26.310
Perfect boss.

05:27.040 --> 05:27.840
Perfect husband.

05:28.080 --> 05:28.955
Zero as a lover.

05:30.360 --> 05:31.680
He probably didn't know

05:31.866 --> 05:33.260
Zhang Yousen had invited his wife.

05:34.680 --> 05:36.760
But the moment he saw her,

05:37.320 --> 05:39.180
he had already decided to give me up.

05:40.300 --> 05:41.120
Makes sense.

05:42.520 --> 05:43.920
What else could he do?

05:45.960 --> 05:47.320
If it is really like you said,

05:48.200 --> 05:48.800
that his wife

05:48.830 --> 05:49.600
and his subordinate

05:49.600 --> 05:50.840
have cornered him,

05:51.040 --> 05:52.280
what else could he do

05:52.280 --> 05:53.266
other than give you up?

05:54.840 --> 05:56.800
Consort Yang was favored above all,

05:57.400 --> 05:58.000
yet in the end,

05:58.200 --> 05:59.760
she was forced to die at Mawei Slope.

06:00.520 --> 06:01.600
Who do you think you are?

06:08.111 --> 06:09.444
Harsh words are hard to hear.

06:10.600 --> 06:11.680
Take it or leave it.

06:13.120 --> 06:14.600
But in this situation,

06:14.880 --> 06:16.955
you should be paying
attention to Zhang Yousen.

06:17.960 --> 06:19.600
If he arranged

06:20.080 --> 06:20.960
all of this,

06:21.360 --> 06:22.840
then the one feeling uneasy now

06:23.560 --> 06:24.480
should be Lawyer Bei.

06:26.640 --> 06:28.320
Zhang Yousen is about to go to Chengdu.

06:28.888 --> 06:29.977
No matter how complicated,

06:30.244 --> 06:31.120
this will be settled.

06:31.880 --> 06:32.800
How can you be sure

06:32.800 --> 06:33.960
he will still go?

06:36.444 --> 06:38.466
Miss this chance,
and there will not be another.

06:39.400 --> 06:40.480
If he does not go,

06:41.040 --> 06:42.440
he will remain under Lawyer Bei

06:42.440 --> 06:43.160
for years.

06:44.440 --> 06:46.320
If he were as calculating as you say,

06:46.711 --> 06:48.640
he would not give up
a fast promotion opportunity

06:49.000 --> 06:50.520
just to stay for me.

06:51.600 --> 06:52.520
Originally,

06:52.760 --> 06:54.040
he wanted both love and a career.

06:54.560 --> 06:55.760
Now, he can only choose one.

06:56.577 --> 06:57.622
He will choose a career.

06:58.000 --> 06:58.880
That is certain.

06:59.560 --> 07:00.240
If he stays,

07:00.400 --> 07:02.200
he may lose both.

07:05.177 --> 07:07.244
I would rather believe
the Zhang Yousen I know

07:07.266 --> 07:08.640
is just someone ruled by love.

07:10.755 --> 07:12.440
Those who should
be ruled by love are not.

07:12.622 --> 07:15.022
Those who should not be ruled by love
only become more determined.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.640
Who is ruled by love?

07:17.880 --> 07:18.320
My dad.

07:20.280 --> 07:21.040
Starting today,

07:21.360 --> 07:22.560
he is going to the gym.

07:22.740 --> 07:23.760
He said that in a few days,

07:23.760 --> 07:25.240
he will come to show us the results.

07:26.160 --> 07:28.600
He told me he has found someone

07:28.933 --> 07:30.680
to spend the rest of his life with.

07:46.577 --> 07:47.880
It's Lin Zhanqiao, right?

07:49.133 --> 07:52.000
A few days ago, he already asked me
to pass the message to you.

07:52.600 --> 07:53.040
I really

07:53.040 --> 07:54.640
held it in until now.

07:54.640 --> 07:55.520
If I didn't say it...

07:55.760 --> 07:56.560
Stop laughing.

07:56.560 --> 07:57.200
I was afraid

07:57.200 --> 07:59.040
he would come himself
and tell you directly.

07:59.111 --> 08:00.380
And you will be startled, right?

08:02.160 --> 08:03.240
You have already shocked me.

08:03.880 --> 08:05.000
Ms. Lin, my dad's relationships

08:05.000 --> 08:06.000
have nothing to do with me.

08:06.000 --> 08:07.280
We're different.

08:07.280 --> 08:08.640
Just treat us separately.

08:08.840 --> 08:10.755
Tell your dad to stop.
There is no chance.

08:10.960 --> 08:12.600
He is not Lin Zhanqiao's type.

08:29.660 --> 08:31.940
(5 messages from Gu Yan: [image])

09:02.280 --> 09:03.000
Where are you?

09:03.120 --> 09:04.800
Why are you not answering my calls?

09:04.920 --> 09:05.800
Not in a good mood.

09:06.280 --> 09:07.422
Out getting some air.

09:08.520 --> 09:09.280
Do not worry.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.280
I didn't go far.

09:11.080 --> 09:12.240
From Shanghai,

09:12.240 --> 09:13.977
it is at most an hour and a half drive.

09:15.480 --> 09:16.800
Will you come back today?

09:17.155 --> 09:18.400
If you are coming back,

09:18.480 --> 09:19.560
I can come find you later.

09:20.600 --> 09:21.680
Not sure.

09:22.880 --> 09:24.720
If I don't come back,

09:25.640 --> 09:26.680
will you come find me?

09:27.920 --> 09:28.720
After work,

09:29.177 --> 09:31.066
no matter how late, I can wait.

09:32.160 --> 09:33.240
I just want to talk to you.

09:33.880 --> 09:35.800
I know what you
want to talk to me about.

09:36.960 --> 09:38.680
Right now, I am working with He Han.

09:38.680 --> 09:40.320
We are putting on a show for Mr. Fan.

09:40.680 --> 09:42.320
We need him to believe

09:43.280 --> 09:44.800
Chenxing's future includes He Han.

09:44.800 --> 09:45.920
So he will invest in us.

09:47.644 --> 09:49.711
The contract will be
signed in the next few days.

09:49.880 --> 09:52.480
So, I hope you can keep
this confidential for now.

09:53.080 --> 09:54.680
Even if I believe what you said,

09:55.360 --> 09:56.320
even if I accept

09:56.960 --> 09:58.080
He Han's influence on you,

09:58.880 --> 09:59.680
aside from that,

10:01.280 --> 10:02.600
can I have an answer?

10:05.320 --> 10:05.960
Do you love me?

10:15.120 --> 10:16.720
If I continue to give you

10:17.200 --> 10:18.920
all my time and energy,

10:22.320 --> 10:23.760
can that make you love me?

10:29.040 --> 10:30.360
Whether I love you or not

10:30.880 --> 10:32.440
has nothing to do with what you do

10:32.440 --> 10:33.960
or what you will do.

10:34.240 --> 10:35.640
I think you do love me.

10:36.088 --> 10:37.480
That's why I just keep writing

10:37.480 --> 10:38.760
every single day

10:38.760 --> 10:40.200
without stopping.

10:40.880 --> 10:42.000
I am not doing it

10:42.000 --> 10:43.200
for the money you mentioned.

10:45.400 --> 10:46.360
I am poor.

10:48.280 --> 10:49.320
I need money.

10:49.880 --> 10:52.920
But I have never thought
about how much I want to earn.

10:55.200 --> 10:56.480
Everything I do is for you.

10:58.640 --> 11:00.080
I write well for you.

11:01.600 --> 11:03.120
I reach the top rankings for you.

11:03.120 --> 11:05.040
Even when I earn a lot of money,
it is for you.

11:09.800 --> 11:11.120
I just hope you can...

11:14.640 --> 11:15.280
You can...

11:16.600 --> 11:18.040
You can like me,

11:19.000 --> 11:19.520
love me,

11:20.920 --> 11:22.400
and not leave me.

11:24.800 --> 11:26.720
I hope everything you do

11:26.920 --> 11:28.120
is for yourself.

11:28.600 --> 11:30.333
I care about you, and I look after you

11:30.520 --> 11:31.680
because I am your boss

11:31.680 --> 11:32.640
and you are my employee.

11:33.511 --> 11:35.520
But I hope you can be
clear about your position

11:35.520 --> 11:36.880
and the relationship between us.

11:38.920 --> 11:39.900
We can talk about money,

11:40.240 --> 11:41.240
cooperation,

11:42.000 --> 11:43.480
and compensation.

11:43.480 --> 11:44.444
All of that is fine.

11:45.155 --> 11:46.666
But we don't talk about feelings.

11:52.200 --> 11:54.040
You never said this to me before.

11:57.840 --> 11:59.520
Then, take it as me saying it now.

12:08.000 --> 12:09.466
I don't want to write anymore.

12:10.511 --> 12:13.040
I don't know why I have to write these
meaningless things every day.

12:13.040 --> 12:14.133
Find someone else to write.

12:33.440 --> 12:34.320
I want to see you now.

12:40.720 --> 12:41.120
Morning.

12:41.720 --> 12:42.520
Morning, Ms. Lin.

12:43.480 --> 12:44.840
Has Gu Yan contacted you?

12:44.880 --> 12:46.560
He must submit tonight.

12:46.880 --> 12:49.080
Otherwise, we will miss the update
tomorrow afternoon.

12:49.880 --> 12:50.720
And now, Dingqi

12:50.720 --> 12:52.040
is about to sign with us, right?

12:52.440 --> 12:53.960
If our most important author

12:53.960 --> 12:54.720
does not submit,

12:54.720 --> 12:56.000
it will affect us.

12:58.333 --> 12:59.760
He is probably not in Shanghai.

13:00.133 --> 13:02.200
He sent me a few photos.
I will send them to you.

13:02.320 --> 13:03.360
Check where that is.

13:03.360 --> 13:04.070
Okay.

13:05.288 --> 13:07.000
Zhang Yousen said he is not leaving.

13:49.400 --> 13:51.555
Some things are not
convenient to say at the office.

13:52.022 --> 13:53.222
I want to stay in Shanghai.

13:56.800 --> 13:58.240
So, you chose love over a career?

13:58.520 --> 13:59.120
I want both.

13:59.280 --> 13:59.920
On what basis?

14:00.333 --> 14:01.688
Your relationship with Zhou Mei.

14:02.711 --> 14:04.720
That day, when she asked me
to act as her boyfriend

14:04.720 --> 14:05.670
to have dinner with you,

14:05.680 --> 14:06.520
I already noticed.

14:09.377 --> 14:11.480
That day, when you proposed
and asked me to join,

14:11.880 --> 14:13.000
I figured it out as well.

14:14.240 --> 14:15.920
Then, my wife suddenly appeared.

14:16.680 --> 14:18.160
That was your doing too, right?

14:21.000 --> 14:21.760
Originally,

14:22.422 --> 14:23.733
if she had accepted the ring

14:23.822 --> 14:25.380
and our relationship had been confirmed,

14:25.390 --> 14:26.720
everything would have worked out.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.320
What do you want now?

14:28.688 --> 14:31.360
Are you trying to use my relationship
with Zhou Mei to threaten me?

14:31.800 --> 14:32.760
You have no evidence.

14:32.760 --> 14:34.000
I could turn around and sue you.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.244
I care too much about Zhou Mei

14:35.520 --> 14:36.840
to use her as a tool.

14:38.960 --> 14:40.640
In Wangyue Legal Consulting,

14:40.955 --> 14:42.720
Zhou Mei is
the legal representative, right?

14:42.780 --> 14:44.860
(Business License.
Legal Representative. Zhou Mei)

14:48.920 --> 14:50.120
All outsourced projects

14:50.760 --> 14:53.200
cannot be registered
under my or my family's name.

14:53.920 --> 14:56.080
Zhou Mei is just a name on paper.

14:56.080 --> 14:57.200
So, Zhou Mei knows

14:57.210 --> 14:58.670
that Wangyue is under investigation?

14:58.680 --> 14:59.355
She knows.

15:00.560 --> 15:01.320
I already told her.

15:01.440 --> 15:03.440
This matter will be handled by someone.

15:03.520 --> 15:04.600
So she should also know

15:05.120 --> 15:06.960
about the two sets of
accounts in the company,

15:07.360 --> 15:07.760
right?

15:14.400 --> 15:15.160
What do you mean?

15:16.840 --> 15:17.920
Some of Wangyue's projects

15:18.200 --> 15:19.160
passed through my hands.

15:23.280 --> 15:24.080
(From what I know,)

15:24.222 --> 15:25.680
(there are issues with the amounts.)

15:25.820 --> 15:27.266
(Third quarter financial statement)
(So I suspect)

15:27.440 --> 15:29.920
(other projects would not hold up either.)

15:32.520 --> 15:33.760
You have a good memory.

15:33.888 --> 15:35.755
A good memory is not as
reliable as written records.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.200
I keep a record

15:37.311 --> 15:39.000
of every document I have handled.

15:41.360 --> 15:41.800
Fine.

15:43.720 --> 15:44.280
Then,

15:45.120 --> 15:46.360
you can check them.

15:47.320 --> 15:49.680
If there are any issues,
we can correct them together.

15:49.960 --> 15:50.760
I think you should

15:50.760 --> 15:52.120
let Zhou Mei know everything.

15:52.622 --> 15:54.760
I am telling you, this has
nothing to do with Zhou Mei.

15:54.760 --> 15:55.680
But once it happens,

15:55.680 --> 15:57.866
as the legal representative,
it directly involves her.

15:58.160 --> 15:58.680
I know.

15:59.640 --> 16:00.520
I will handle it.

16:04.920 --> 16:06.400
You decided not to leave

16:06.720 --> 16:08.240
because you are worried about Zhou Mei?

16:08.377 --> 16:09.600
Lawyer Bei, I have a proposal.

16:09.600 --> 16:10.600
See if it works.

16:12.120 --> 16:13.800
The Wangyue matter is a bit tricky now.

16:14.160 --> 16:15.200
As a senior lawyer,

16:15.280 --> 16:17.044
it's not convenient for
you to intervene directly.

16:17.333 --> 16:18.177
How about this?

16:18.400 --> 16:19.288
I handle it for you.

16:19.577 --> 16:20.866
But you have to promise me

16:20.955 --> 16:22.400
that none of the figures you give me

16:22.520 --> 16:23.440
are concealed.

16:24.240 --> 16:24.680
And...

16:25.720 --> 16:26.920
my condition is that I become

16:26.920 --> 16:28.360
the youngest partner in the firm.

16:28.560 --> 16:29.200
And soon.

16:29.288 --> 16:30.160
That is impossible.

16:31.200 --> 16:32.040
Your experience

16:32.320 --> 16:33.640
is not convincing enough.

16:34.555 --> 16:35.520
You are the boss.

16:35.840 --> 16:36.640
You must have a way.

16:37.755 --> 16:38.730
What about Zhou Mei?

16:38.880 --> 16:40.288
You don't want to involve her.

16:40.600 --> 16:42.400
I step in as the one who saves her.

16:43.320 --> 16:44.760
The important thing is,

16:45.520 --> 16:47.320
I will keep this
confidential from Mrs. Bei.

16:52.160 --> 16:52.560
Fine.

16:54.640 --> 16:56.920
Show me what you are capable of

16:57.920 --> 17:00.080
and let me see
how cleanly you handle it.

17:11.511 --> 17:12.520
Ms. Lin, I am coming in.

17:14.520 --> 17:15.000
What is it?

17:15.320 --> 17:15.880
I found it.

17:16.240 --> 17:16.800
Found what?

17:16.880 --> 17:17.520
Where Gu Yan is.

17:18.377 --> 17:19.240
How did you find it?

17:19.600 --> 17:20.120
My dad.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.880
I sent him the photo of the scenery.

17:22.000 --> 17:23.480
He builds properties everywhere,

17:23.480 --> 17:24.720
so he has been to that place.

17:25.880 --> 17:27.520
Why would he go to Luxu Ancient Town?

17:28.240 --> 17:29.800
Ms. Lin, do you want to go check now?

17:30.880 --> 17:31.320
Listen.

17:32.000 --> 17:32.800
Find an excuse

17:32.880 --> 17:34.200
and call Zhao Lanxin's company.

17:34.200 --> 17:35.155
See if she is there.

17:35.860 --> 17:37.533
What does Zhao Lanxin
have to do with it?

17:37.555 --> 17:39.244
That address is Zhao Lanxin's hometown.

17:39.800 --> 17:40.840
For Gu Yan to go there,

17:40.840 --> 17:42.560
someone must have
arranged it in advance.

17:42.888 --> 17:44.800
With his personality, he would rather
stay in an internet cafe all day

17:44.800 --> 17:46.720
than go into the mountains
to stay at a guesthouse.

17:46.800 --> 17:47.840
Alright, I will do it now.

18:15.000 --> 18:15.440
Zhangzhu,

18:16.460 --> 18:17.840
print out Gu Yan's last ten chapters,

18:17.840 --> 18:20.080
and the outline for
the next twenty chapters, right away.

18:20.200 --> 18:22.040
So he really is not submitting?

18:23.040 --> 18:24.240
We prepare for the worst.

18:25.160 --> 18:26.520
We cannot rely on others.

18:26.520 --> 18:27.640
Depending on others is risky.

18:27.880 --> 18:29.240
The moment something goes wrong,

18:29.360 --> 18:30.360
we will fall hard.

18:32.720 --> 18:33.160
Understood.

18:44.480 --> 18:45.822
You don't plan to keep writing?

18:49.760 --> 18:50.800
If I stop,

18:51.680 --> 18:53.440
I will stop writing for any company.

18:54.520 --> 18:55.160
In the end,

18:56.320 --> 18:57.320
this is

18:58.360 --> 18:59.520
a solitary battle.

18:59.920 --> 19:00.680
Except for myself,

19:01.680 --> 19:02.960
who cannot walk away at will,

19:02.960 --> 19:04.240
everyone else can

19:05.000 --> 19:06.320
come and go as they please.

19:08.280 --> 19:08.920
I have tried it.

19:09.960 --> 19:11.200
I don't like this kind of work.

19:12.555 --> 19:13.680
What do you want to do?

19:14.177 --> 19:16.177
Go back to the internet cafe
as a manager?

19:18.044 --> 19:19.600
It is not the same as playing games.

19:20.160 --> 19:21.160
We have a team.

19:21.960 --> 19:24.000
Our team moves together.

19:26.480 --> 19:29.160
You were in the internet cafe,
playing games while writing,

19:29.160 --> 19:30.688
and Lin Zhanqiao discovered you.

19:31.240 --> 19:32.040
If it were me,

19:32.480 --> 19:33.600
I would let you stay there,

19:34.240 --> 19:35.720
keep playing and writing.

19:39.311 --> 19:41.066
You started writing online fiction

19:41.133 --> 19:42.400
because of Phantom Knight, right?

19:44.200 --> 19:45.920
He Han and Hong Qigong

19:46.080 --> 19:46.960
are nothing.

19:47.520 --> 19:48.680
Only Phantom Knight

19:48.680 --> 19:50.440
is an untouchable legend.

19:52.022 --> 19:53.644
It is a pity he stopped writing.

19:54.200 --> 19:55.800
The genre he was best at

19:55.840 --> 19:56.800
was game transmigration.

19:57.480 --> 19:58.480
If you write that genre,

19:58.480 --> 19:59.888
you will not be worse than him.

20:00.000 --> 20:01.760
What you are writing now,
Drunk Old Friend,

20:02.240 --> 20:03.600
is an outline created

20:03.600 --> 20:04.800
by He Han and Lin Zhanqiao.

20:05.480 --> 20:06.240
It is not yours.

20:07.280 --> 20:08.240
So, you feel constrained,

20:08.422 --> 20:09.800
like you are being controlled.

20:11.377 --> 20:12.577
Go back to the internet cafe.

20:13.040 --> 20:14.560
Go back to your familiar friends.

20:14.880 --> 20:15.960
Write stories you know.

20:16.360 --> 20:17.800
Become the next Phantom Knight.

20:18.800 --> 20:20.200
I will not invest in your novel.

20:21.330 --> 20:22.740
I will invest in your internet cafe.

20:33.155 --> 20:34.555
Let me think about it.

20:38.560 --> 20:39.400
From what we can see,

20:39.720 --> 20:41.200
the updated content has diverged

20:41.200 --> 20:42.260
from the original outline.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.622
That was due to the new map.

20:43.666 --> 20:45.640
Gu Yan had already
adjusted the earlier chapters.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.280
Originally, after this chapter,

20:47.280 --> 20:48.600
he planned to revise the outline.

20:48.720 --> 20:49.640
We revise it for him.

20:49.760 --> 20:50.520
There is no time.

20:50.520 --> 20:51.560
It is already 2:30 PM.

20:51.720 --> 20:53.240
If the submission is due

20:53.240 --> 20:53.880
at 6 PM,

20:53.880 --> 20:56.711
revising the outline and having someone
continue writing will not be enough.

20:56.755 --> 20:58.377
We don't need to revise everything.

20:58.480 --> 21:00.200
We organize the updated direction first,

21:00.280 --> 21:01.200
and then start writing.

21:01.240 --> 21:03.240
Who can write in his place?

21:09.680 --> 21:10.160
I will try.

21:10.600 --> 21:11.000
Ms. Lin,

21:11.355 --> 21:12.760
Dingqi Platform's legal team is here.

21:15.080 --> 21:15.920
So early.

21:18.880 --> 21:19.920
I have an idea, Ms. Lin.

21:21.000 --> 21:22.000
When Gu Yan

21:22.000 --> 21:23.200
wrote this part,

21:23.320 --> 21:24.440
you went to see Mr. He Han

21:24.440 --> 21:26.333
and adjusted the content
together at his hotel.

21:26.640 --> 21:27.320
If Gu Yan

21:27.320 --> 21:29.000
followed his approach,

21:29.010 --> 21:30.444
Mr. He Han should have an idea

21:30.488 --> 21:31.733
about how the story develops next.

21:31.777 --> 21:33.066
Do you want me to ask him?

21:34.040 --> 21:34.480
No.

21:34.640 --> 21:35.800
We solve our own problems.

21:37.940 --> 21:39.260
(Draft Investment Cooperation Agreement
Chenxing Culture Media Co., Ltd.)

21:39.280 --> 21:40.490
Mr. Fan specifically instructed

21:40.640 --> 21:42.640
that all issues be resolved today.

21:42.911 --> 21:44.480
We will pick an auspicious day to sign

21:44.640 --> 21:45.440
and make it public

21:45.640 --> 21:46.680
about our strong alliance.

21:47.480 --> 21:47.840
Alright.

21:48.360 --> 21:49.160
Let us begin.

21:49.955 --> 21:51.040
We have internally reviewed

21:51.040 --> 21:53.000
the contract content.

21:53.880 --> 21:55.240
Our concerns and revisions are...

21:55.240 --> 21:57.100
(Mr. Fan)

21:59.080 --> 21:59.600
Sorry.

22:07.120 --> 22:07.800
Hello, Mr. Fan.

22:08.360 --> 22:09.800
What is going on with Gu Yan?

22:10.688 --> 22:11.840
He is throwing a tantrum?

22:12.000 --> 22:13.080
We have barely started,

22:13.080 --> 22:14.200
and he is already acting up?

22:14.733 --> 22:16.960
Our editor called him,
and he would not even pick up.

22:17.040 --> 22:17.900
What does that mean?

22:19.120 --> 22:20.440
Is he planning to leave you

22:20.440 --> 22:21.320
for another company?

22:22.480 --> 22:23.120
Let me tell you,

22:23.760 --> 22:26.040
he is not just offending Chenxing now,

22:26.360 --> 22:27.920
but he is also offending Dingqi.

22:28.720 --> 22:30.160
Offending such a major platform,

22:30.300 --> 22:32.080
he can forget about
staying in this industry.

22:32.640 --> 22:33.560
Sorry, Mr. Fan.

22:33.960 --> 22:35.360
We are handling this issue.

22:36.240 --> 22:36.800
On one hand,

22:36.888 --> 22:38.560
we are stabilizing
his mood and progress.

22:38.600 --> 22:39.466
On the other hand,

22:39.680 --> 22:40.680
we are also developing

22:40.680 --> 22:42.120
new authors in the same genre.

22:42.120 --> 22:43.320
What if that does not work?

22:46.480 --> 22:48.080
My investment in Chenxing

22:48.680 --> 22:50.200
has not even been announced yet.

22:51.120 --> 22:53.520
And your top author
is already slacking off.

22:54.320 --> 22:55.140
If this gets out,

22:55.640 --> 22:57.480
will people not laugh at me?

22:59.911 --> 23:01.177
So he will not write?

23:01.440 --> 23:02.720
If he refuses, then forget it.

23:03.960 --> 23:04.560
Here is

23:05.600 --> 23:06.790
what I think.

23:07.720 --> 23:08.920
Drunk Old Friend

23:09.800 --> 23:10.960
was originally

23:12.240 --> 23:14.480
based on a story outline
developed by He Han and you,

23:14.480 --> 23:14.880
right?

23:15.400 --> 23:17.480
It should have been written by He Han.

23:19.360 --> 23:20.680
Given the situation,

23:22.040 --> 23:23.720
if He Han returns,

23:24.480 --> 23:26.360
it can even become a good story.

23:26.600 --> 23:27.000
Right?

23:28.960 --> 23:29.440
Impossible.

23:34.840 --> 23:35.720
Then, by 9 PM tonight,

23:36.088 --> 23:37.266
the draft must be submitted.

23:38.280 --> 23:39.280
Figure it out yourself.

23:50.822 --> 23:52.733
Does this mean
we are ending the meeting?

23:53.280 --> 23:55.080
Mr. Fan asked us to give you some time

23:55.320 --> 23:57.080
to handle the urgent situation.

23:57.090 --> 23:58.720
We will confirm
the contract another day.

23:58.760 --> 23:59.560
Thank you, Ms. Lin.

23:59.960 --> 24:00.360
Let's go.

24:03.440 --> 24:04.440
What do they mean?

24:04.480 --> 24:05.320
They are not signing?

24:05.440 --> 24:06.080
It is deliberate.

24:06.360 --> 24:07.440
If we mishandle this,

24:07.760 --> 24:08.680
they can find fault

24:08.680 --> 24:09.720
and push down our price.

24:10.400 --> 24:11.800
Gu Yan's update cannot go wrong.

24:11.920 --> 24:13.400
Neither timing nor quality can fail.

24:17.720 --> 24:18.720
This outline was created

24:18.720 --> 24:19.720
by you and Gu Yan?

24:22.880 --> 24:23.920
What is this writing?

24:23.960 --> 24:24.920
It is completely off.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.960
I built the story framework properly,

24:26.960 --> 24:28.040
and he wrote it like this.

24:28.040 --> 24:29.400
The characters and tone are all off.

24:29.920 --> 24:30.780
Then, maybe...

24:31.200 --> 24:32.120
Let it go, then.

24:32.120 --> 24:33.080
I will head back first.

24:33.240 --> 24:34.280
My boss already told me

24:34.280 --> 24:35.520
not to come find you.

24:35.760 --> 24:37.040
I came to you myself.

24:37.800 --> 24:38.960
What is she going to do, then?

24:39.111 --> 24:40.288
Write it herself?

24:40.680 --> 24:41.640
If it comes to it,

24:41.640 --> 24:42.980
she will have to write it herself.

24:45.000 --> 24:46.511
She brought this on herself.

24:47.200 --> 24:48.160
She should never

24:48.160 --> 24:50.000
have used Gu Yan.

24:50.000 --> 24:50.760
He is unreliable.

24:50.760 --> 24:51.640
Mr. He Han,

24:51.640 --> 24:53.480
can you help my boss?

24:53.480 --> 24:55.240
She is really overwhelmed right now.

24:58.080 --> 24:58.480
Hello.

24:59.466 --> 25:00.480
Are you at the hotel?

25:00.840 --> 25:02.240
When will today's update be ready?

25:02.444 --> 25:03.200
I am writing it now.

25:03.220 --> 25:04.111
I will send it tonight.

25:05.600 --> 25:06.830
Do not say I am not loyal.

25:06.880 --> 25:08.466
Everyone has their own burden to carry.

25:09.977 --> 25:11.520
(Request payment)
What is this transfer?

25:11.640 --> 25:12.840
Just some moral support.

25:13.280 --> 25:15.440
Go back and buy everyone
some milk tea or late-night snacks.

25:15.440 --> 25:17.520
Say that Mr. He Han
appreciates everyone's hard work.

25:18.200 --> 25:18.990
Get through tonight,

25:19.000 --> 25:20.240
and tomorrow will be a new day.

25:20.560 --> 25:21.480
Come on.

25:21.780 --> 25:22.640
Mr. He Han,

25:23.000 --> 25:24.680
you cannot refuse to help my boss.

25:24.680 --> 25:26.640
- I can help, but not with this.
- She is about to lose it.

25:26.640 --> 25:28.000
She is really about to lose it now.

25:28.320 --> 25:29.760
No, how am I supposed to help?

25:30.000 --> 25:31.940
I don't even have time
to finish my own update.

25:32.160 --> 25:33.880
And your boss would
never accept my help.

25:33.880 --> 25:35.360
She would never come to me for it.

25:35.800 --> 25:36.760
Even if I help her,

25:36.840 --> 25:38.120
you will still get fired

25:38.120 --> 25:39.400
for asking me again and again.

25:39.720 --> 25:40.880
Why did you call me here?

25:40.880 --> 25:42.390
I just wanted to
understand the situation.

25:42.400 --> 25:43.920
Now that you understand it,
you still will not help?

25:43.920 --> 25:45.190
- She will be really upset.
- Alright.

25:45.190 --> 25:46.120
Thanks for coming.

25:46.280 --> 25:47.020
Head back now.

25:47.480 --> 25:47.840
Go on.

25:47.960 --> 25:48.560
Bye.

25:48.640 --> 25:48.960
You...

25:49.480 --> 25:50.700
Remember to buy milk tea.

25:54.400 --> 25:55.920
If you don't care about her, I do.

26:51.480 --> 26:52.680
Make some space here.

26:52.680 --> 26:54.590
There is a gap here.
I will check with the backend.

26:54.600 --> 26:55.580
Okay, I will fix it now.

26:57.120 --> 26:57.920
Hey, take a look.

26:58.120 --> 26:58.800
Is this okay?

27:00.040 --> 27:00.680
Move it up.

27:01.010 --> 27:01.660
Okay.

27:10.000 --> 27:10.840
Any news from Gu Yan?

27:11.120 --> 27:12.320
No, he is not answering.

27:13.480 --> 27:14.320
It is almost time.

27:23.900 --> 27:27.140
(Finally...)

27:55.940 --> 27:58.620
(Zhao Lanxin)

27:58.640 --> 28:00.240
Lin Zhanqiao is
going to write it for you.

28:45.900 --> 28:51.340
(End of Chapter)

29:14.920 --> 29:15.240
Hello.

29:16.240 --> 29:16.760
How is it?

29:16.888 --> 29:18.911
It has been a while
since you wrote yourself, right?

29:19.200 --> 29:20.680
Feels a bit off, right?

29:20.840 --> 29:22.840
Especially under this kind of pressure,

29:22.840 --> 29:23.480
it wasn't easy.

29:23.490 --> 29:25.110
When you are done,
I will come find you for a drink.

29:25.120 --> 29:25.900
I have not finished.

29:26.160 --> 29:26.933
Do not come find me.

29:27.960 --> 29:29.040
Let me tell you,

29:29.311 --> 29:30.400
don't write narrative.

29:30.680 --> 29:32.240
Narrative gives you away too easily.

29:32.320 --> 29:34.320
Sharp readers will notice in a few lines

29:34.330 --> 29:35.640
that it's not the original writer.

29:35.800 --> 29:36.560
Just write dialogue.

29:37.040 --> 29:38.640
The denser, the better.

29:38.800 --> 29:39.840
Stretch it however you can.

29:40.360 --> 29:41.830
Alright, that is it. No time.

29:51.440 --> 29:52.120
Guys,

29:52.300 --> 29:54.060
Mr. He Han is treating
everyone to milk tea.

29:54.060 --> 29:55.200
Come on.

29:55.200 --> 29:56.350
There are desserts, too.

29:56.350 --> 29:57.520
- From Mr. He Han.
- Here.

29:57.520 --> 29:58.960
It has to be Mr. He Han.

29:58.960 --> 29:59.570
Come. Here.

29:59.680 --> 30:01.690
- Still thinking of Chenxing this late.
- Here.

30:01.710 --> 30:03.890
- Unlike Gu Yan.
- Dessert, too.

30:03.950 --> 30:05.790
- Wins an award and drops everything.
- Dessert.

30:05.830 --> 30:06.800
You know,

30:06.920 --> 30:09.210
I have seen plenty of
delays and missed updates.

30:09.280 --> 30:10.920
- But someone this bold?
- Thanks.

30:11.000 --> 30:12.340
This is a first.

30:12.400 --> 30:14.040
Just got popular for a few days,

30:14.400 --> 30:15.680
and he already went missing,

30:15.830 --> 30:17.880
- leaving such a mess for Ms. Lin.
- Do you want it?

30:17.930 --> 30:19.780
Who is going to fill in?

30:20.480 --> 30:21.680
Can you keep your voice down?

30:21.680 --> 30:22.920
Afraid she cannot hear you?

30:23.200 --> 30:25.440
The one suffering the most is Ms. Lin.

30:26.000 --> 30:27.000
She spent so much time

30:27.000 --> 30:27.920
and effort

30:28.040 --> 30:28.760
training him.

30:29.120 --> 30:31.120
And right before
Dingqi Platform's investment,

30:31.130 --> 30:32.300
he stabbed her in the back.

30:32.640 --> 30:34.840
Let me tell you,
if this is not handled well,

30:35.444 --> 30:36.800
lowering the price is one thing.

30:36.960 --> 30:38.530
They might even cancel the deal.

30:38.840 --> 30:40.680
Mr. He Han, you came in person?

30:41.160 --> 30:42.120
Is the milk tea good?

30:42.120 --> 30:42.920
- Hello, Mr. He Han.
- Hello, Mr. He Han.

30:42.920 --> 30:43.560
As long as it tastes good.

30:43.560 --> 30:44.160
Thank you, Mr. He Han.

30:44.160 --> 30:45.000
Thanks for the milk tea.

30:45.080 --> 30:46.120
No problem.

30:46.120 --> 30:46.840
Thank you.

30:47.822 --> 30:49.380
We are on the same side, after all.

30:50.940 --> 30:51.730
Look at that.

30:55.560 --> 30:56.280
Do not disturb me.

30:56.680 --> 30:58.080
I came to check on you.

30:58.240 --> 30:58.760
How is it?

30:59.688 --> 31:00.955
How much have you written?

31:01.600 --> 31:02.840
Not even half?

31:02.840 --> 31:04.320
How will you make it, Lin Zhanqiao?

31:05.644 --> 31:06.480
Let me tell you,

31:06.480 --> 31:08.120
you only have one option now.

31:08.200 --> 31:09.400
Make it shorter.

31:09.520 --> 31:10.760
The word count does not matter.

31:10.760 --> 31:11.960
Just explain it to readers.

31:11.960 --> 31:13.110
Say the author is not feeling well

31:13.120 --> 31:13.840
and cannot finish.

31:14.120 --> 31:15.320
Or say this chapter is shorter

31:15.320 --> 31:16.520
because the next one will be big.

31:16.520 --> 31:17.600
Explain it however you want.

31:17.600 --> 31:19.530
- Because the next chapter...
- Can you shut up?

31:20.000 --> 31:21.560
I am trying to help you.

31:22.040 --> 31:24.200
How long will
Dingqi Platform's editor wait?

31:24.840 --> 31:25.760
At most until 9 PM.

31:25.880 --> 31:27.160
With your current state,

31:27.160 --> 31:28.990
you will get 200 words at most by then.

31:29.020 --> 31:30.310
And they still have to review it.

31:30.320 --> 31:31.960
They cannot just publish it.

31:32.022 --> 31:33.200
So you cannot submit at 9 PM.

31:33.200 --> 31:35.440
- You need to submit by 8:50 PM...
- Can you stop talking?

31:36.000 --> 31:36.720
Get out!

31:36.840 --> 31:38.240
You just want to see me fail, right?

31:38.260 --> 31:39.500
- I don't.
- You just want to see

31:39.500 --> 31:40.350
Gu Yan miss the update

31:40.380 --> 31:41.933
and watch us make a fool of ourselves!

31:48.020 --> 31:50.720
Dingqi Platform's editor is asking if we
can still submit today.

31:50.720 --> 31:51.740
- They are about to...
- Thank them.

31:51.760 --> 31:52.680
Tell them not to wait.

31:52.800 --> 31:54.488
I will issue a statement tomorrow.

31:56.080 --> 31:57.280
A statement.

32:22.660 --> 32:25.900
(He Han: Chapter 215
Drunk Old Friend, Hidden Depths.docx)

32:35.260 --> 32:37.740
(Chapter 215
Drunk Old Friend, Hidden Depths.docx)

33:26.280 --> 33:26.760
Zhangzhu.

33:29.240 --> 33:29.640
Ms. Lin,

33:29.800 --> 33:31.290
tell Dingqi Platform's editor to wait.

33:31.520 --> 33:32.200
Okay.

33:34.920 --> 33:36.120
This...

33:40.480 --> 33:41.150
Mr. He Han...

33:43.080 --> 33:44.280
I knew he was something else.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.466
You all go back and rest.

33:46.488 --> 33:47.600
You have worked hard all day.

33:48.222 --> 33:50.600
I will input and edit this now
and send it to Dingqi Platform.

33:50.760 --> 33:52.600
You can come to work
two hours later tomorrow.

33:52.960 --> 33:54.200
Okay, I will go tell them.

33:54.600 --> 33:55.080
Remember,

33:55.600 --> 33:56.560
don't mention He Han.

33:57.560 --> 33:58.240
Just say Gu Yan

33:58.240 --> 33:59.360
sent the draft himself.

34:00.080 --> 34:00.580
Understood.

34:15.511 --> 34:16.711
(One new message from one contact.)

34:16.740 --> 34:19.180
(Thank you.)

34:19.590 --> 34:23.060
♪My heart is beating still♪

34:23.800 --> 34:26.830
♪Sometimes I feel alone♪

34:27.710 --> 34:30.630
♪But love should not be frail♪

34:35.040 --> 34:41.980
♪Is there a spell♪

34:41.980 --> 34:45.830
♪That binds and lingers bare♪

34:48.690 --> 34:53.330
♪If there is a way♪

34:55.080 --> 34:55.400
Hello.

34:57.210 --> 34:58.240
It will be done soon.

34:58.630 --> 34:59.320
Really.

34:59.560 --> 35:00.520
At most 45 minutes.

35:03.610 --> 35:06.380
♪I'm nothing but the one♪

35:06.380 --> 35:10.670
♪Who paints the blue sky♪

35:11.540 --> 35:13.080
♪With all of my tears♪

35:13.080 --> 35:14.800
♪And past pain♪

35:15.060 --> 35:16.790
♪I will still try♪

35:20.140 --> 35:23.790
♪Please stay with me♪

35:24.440 --> 35:27.690
♪I could've held you in my arms♪

35:28.000 --> 35:30.750
♪When I said love♪

35:31.400 --> 35:31.800
Bye.

35:31.844 --> 35:32.960
- Bye.
- See you tomorrow.

35:32.960 --> 35:33.720
- Sleep early.
- Bye.

35:33.730 --> 35:34.490
Bye.

35:35.200 --> 35:36.160
Mr. He Han,

35:36.520 --> 35:38.040
you wrote it so well.

35:38.120 --> 35:39.440
So well!

35:47.720 --> 35:48.920
I really underestimated you.

35:50.840 --> 35:51.640
I am a lawyer.

35:52.520 --> 35:54.240
I always prepare for the worst.

35:57.400 --> 35:58.280
About the company,

35:58.680 --> 35:59.790
what did Lawyer Bei tell you?

36:01.000 --> 36:02.840
He asked you
to handle some audit issues.

36:03.533 --> 36:05.111
What do you think this company is?

36:05.600 --> 36:06.760
Proof of your relationship?

36:07.420 --> 36:08.840
Or do you think Lawyer Bei loves you,

36:08.933 --> 36:10.866
so he invested in starting
this company for you?

36:13.333 --> 36:14.720
You don't need to use this company

36:14.720 --> 36:16.600
to drive a wedge
between Lawyer Bei and me.

36:17.280 --> 36:19.160
I am in my thirties, not eighteen.

36:19.555 --> 36:21.580
I go into business
and start companies with people

36:21.760 --> 36:22.800
for one purpose only,

36:22.911 --> 36:23.777
which is making money.

36:25.100 --> 36:26.280
Lawyer Bei has the resources,

36:26.280 --> 36:27.577
so why would I not work with him?

36:28.960 --> 36:30.200
Only people your age

36:30.200 --> 36:31.440
think having names together

36:31.440 --> 36:32.560
means a declaration of love.

36:33.800 --> 36:34.240
Of course,

36:35.360 --> 36:36.440
I am not defending him.

36:37.160 --> 36:38.240
I just want to tell you

36:38.760 --> 36:40.000
I have my own judgment.

36:40.560 --> 36:41.920
Just tell me the facts.

36:42.800 --> 36:43.840
If you want facts,

36:44.160 --> 36:44.520
fine.

36:44.955 --> 36:46.333
Let me ask you something.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.240
Do you think a company like yours

36:49.640 --> 36:50.480
is the only one?

36:52.622 --> 36:53.480
Or are there others?

36:53.520 --> 36:54.733
Have you thought about it?

36:58.266 --> 36:59.440
Do you know if there are...

36:59.440 --> 37:00.040
I don't know.

37:00.600 --> 37:01.640
You should ask Lawyer Bei.

37:02.480 --> 37:03.560
But from what I can see,

37:03.800 --> 37:05.760
only your company is under audit.

37:06.160 --> 37:07.280
And the risk you face

37:07.560 --> 37:09.400
is heavy back taxes and penalties.

37:10.960 --> 37:11.750
Me or us?

37:11.800 --> 37:12.550
You.

37:13.840 --> 37:15.360
From what I can see, Lawyer Bei

37:15.360 --> 37:17.066
has no direct
connection to this company.

37:20.200 --> 37:21.920
So you are saying I was used?

37:22.440 --> 37:23.720
At least, it is not love.

37:24.840 --> 37:26.200
Love should put you first

37:26.200 --> 37:27.200
and be honest with you.

37:28.955 --> 37:30.520
He even knew I was coming to see you.

37:30.644 --> 37:32.666
He should have
explained everything to you.

37:32.760 --> 37:33.680
But did he contact you?

37:33.920 --> 37:34.960
Did he explain anything?

37:35.680 --> 37:37.600
If not, why are you
still entangled with him?

37:50.880 --> 37:51.520
Let me ask you.

37:54.200 --> 37:56.280
If the company under
my name has tax issues now,

37:57.200 --> 37:58.440
if you are afraid of trouble,

37:58.440 --> 37:59.620
do you want to stay away from me?

37:59.630 --> 38:01.080
I like taking on trouble.

38:03.577 --> 38:05.933
Otherwise, how would
I earn Lawyer Bei's trust,

38:07.044 --> 38:09.355
and how would I dare pursue you,
Zhou Mei?

38:22.760 --> 38:24.400
You have really surprised me today.

38:39.910 --> 38:45.260
♪If the sky and the sea
turned upside down♪

38:47.480 --> 38:51.110
♪If a swimming fish fell
in love with a flying bird♪

38:51.820 --> 38:53.260
(Mom)

38:54.560 --> 39:01.460
♪If back then we had never let go♪

39:02.390 --> 39:07.490
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

39:09.460 --> 39:11.940
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

39:11.940 --> 39:13.660
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

39:13.660 --> 39:16.410
♪And found our way back whole♪

39:17.170 --> 39:19.390
♪So let this surging love♪

39:19.400 --> 39:23.890
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

39:24.730 --> 39:27.710
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain,
that's alright♪

39:28.400 --> 39:31.660
♪If we're buried by passing years,
all the better♪

39:32.170 --> 39:34.480
♪At least we still can keep♪

39:34.480 --> 39:38.070
♪This one eternal photograph♪

40:07.020 --> 40:09.980
(Year 2018)

40:25.680 --> 40:26.460
Your turn.

40:28.920 --> 40:30.720
Wake up, your turn.

40:32.520 --> 40:32.960
Really.

40:33.080 --> 40:34.520
Hurry up. Take a look.

40:34.520 --> 40:35.680
Take a look now.

40:35.680 --> 40:36.160
Come.

40:36.400 --> 40:36.840
Come.

40:37.200 --> 40:37.840
Good.

40:37.960 --> 40:38.800
You finished writing?

40:47.880 --> 40:48.980
How many fingers?

40:51.280 --> 40:51.640
Three.

41:35.000 --> 41:35.560
Hey,

41:38.880 --> 41:40.160
are you an eraser or what?

41:56.500 --> 41:59.460
(Year 2018)

42:06.200 --> 42:07.440
First, I would stop you.

42:08.160 --> 42:09.640
But if you insist,

42:09.755 --> 42:11.040
I will go with you and kill them.

42:11.360 --> 42:12.120
No.

42:12.244 --> 42:13.480
Bringing you would slow me down.

42:13.480 --> 42:14.630
I would have to think about your safety.

42:14.640 --> 42:15.720
I would rather go alone.

42:15.720 --> 42:16.250
And...

42:16.520 --> 42:17.680
I don't want to involve you.

42:18.240 --> 42:19.730
But that is not involving me.

42:20.280 --> 42:21.280
And how can you be sure

42:21.280 --> 42:23.360
you alone can kill their whole family

42:23.360 --> 42:24.920
and still get away safely?

42:25.200 --> 42:26.920
I am already prepared to be caught.

42:26.920 --> 42:28.160
I cannot involve you even more.

42:28.560 --> 42:29.560
You have to finish

42:29.560 --> 42:30.640
what I cannot finish for me.

42:31.120 --> 42:32.800
How about this? You charge in,

42:32.960 --> 42:34.111
and I cover you from behind.

42:34.240 --> 42:35.280
You mean we go together?

42:35.400 --> 42:37.400
I go in to kill them,
and you keep watch outside?

42:37.440 --> 42:39.000
Yes. And if it really comes to it,

42:39.044 --> 42:40.280
you can call for help inside,

42:40.280 --> 42:41.222
and I will rush in.

42:41.577 --> 42:43.520
Call for help?
After I kill their whole family,

42:43.520 --> 42:44.460
I call for help?

42:44.600 --> 42:46.288
They should be
the ones calling for help.

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
